					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12208512#post-4308644</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12208512/scp-281-fr#post-4308644</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 17 Jul 2019 22:41:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Beachfox</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1422625</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The different nature of the GOC in the France-SCP semicanon threw me for a bit, but then I got into the tale of trying to keep magic swords from pissed off magicians.</p> <p>Then we got to the twist. And oh my, it is a <em>delight</em>.</p> <p>Mad props to the translator. And extra mad props to the original author for just&#8230; everything.</p> <p>Honestly, &quot;turn Flat Earth into Round Earth via magic swords&quot; almost gets over shadowed by the joy of &quot;The Illuminati's Secret Chatroom&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
